Recover pods after suspended SSH connections

Process a host disconnect without waiting for in-flight per-pod tunnel
repairs. This prevents several pods on one SSH host from serially
blocking the host transition, while a repair epoch stops stale tunnel
results from overwriting the disconnected state. OpenSSH and the user's
configuration remain responsible for control-master detection and
cleanup.

Enable rumpelpod INFO logs in the generated systemd user service. Log
host and pod connection transitions needed to diagnose future outages.
